        "id": 246936,
        "name": "",
        "username": "fjur",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/fjur/{size}/4849_2.png",
        "created_at": "2022-08-01T15:39:17.500Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Godai\" data-post=\"2\" data-topic=\"29537\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/godai/48/1920_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Godai:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>First issue is Benchmark and the Sentinels were not around in the 90’s…</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Argh! Curse you, Godai! Well, everything happened in the ’90s.</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Godai\" data-post=\"2\" data-topic=\"29537\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/godai/48/1920_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Godai:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I would also rate Wraith as higher than 5 for fighting ability.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>But 6 is “Master of several fighting styles” and 7 is “Master of all fighting styles.” If my memory serves me, there is only one card in The Wraith’s deck that is actually based on her fighting ability: Combat Stance. The rest of her stuff is just tech. Also, C&amp;A have never really confirmed how many, if any, fighting styles The Wraith has mastered. The same goes for Mister Fixer. I gave him Fighting Ability 6, because he’s definitely not a 7. And I gave The Wraith a 5, because I think she should be lower than him.</p>",
